// Insurance star-schema model in Power BI — Microsoft Power BI Data Analyst Associate (PL-300)
// Goal: Build a clean semantic model for premium/claims reporting.
// Concepts: Star schema, Relationships & cardinality, Single-direction filtering, Date dimension (marked), Measures vs calculated columns
// Add these measures to a Power BI star-schema model (see README).

Written Premium = SUM ( Fact[written_premium] )

Loss Ratio = DIVIDE ( SUM ( Fact[incurred_loss] ), [Written Premium] )

Written Premium LY =
CALCULATE ( [Written Premium], SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR ( 'Date'[Date] ) )

YoY Growth % = DIVIDE ( [Written Premium] - [Written Premium LY], [Written Premium LY] )

